## Wake word feature models

Not shipped yet. When they are, they come from openWakeWord
(https://github.com/dscripka/openWakeWord) under the Apache License
2.0, and its NOTICE and attribution terms will be recorded here.

The wake word itself is never shipped. An application supplies the
model for the phrase it wants.
